      "role": "user",
      "content": "right, that makes sense. it sounds like the whole setup is basically just a way for big powers to look like they're doing something while actually just protecting themselves. besides the funding and the veto thing, what are the main ways these globalist policies end up actively harming a smaller country's ability to run its own affairs?",
