      "content": "so it basically feels like these organizations are just tools for powerful countries to impose their will under the guise of \"global standards.\" if the goal is really about cooperation, why does it always seem to work out in favor of the big players and against the sovereignty of everyone else? is there even a legitimate way for these groups to function without being biased toward the most powerful states?",
